==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|LL.|lanceāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|lanceō}}, from {{inh|es|la|lancea}}, of {{der|es|xce|-}} origin. Compare Catalan {{m|ca|llançar}}, Asturian {{m|ast|llanzar}}, French {{m|fr|lancer}}, Italian {{m|it|lanciare}}, Occitan and Portuguese {{m|pt|lançar}}. {{doublet|es|lancear}}, a later borrowing.

